"Bridge between Inventory and the WhatsApp connector of Odoo Mates: ready "
"WhatsApp templates and a Send by WhatsApp button on transfers; a delivery "
"that is done can go to the customer by WhatsApp automatically, once, as set "
"on each operation type, with the tracking number and link of the carrier "
"when there is one."
